      "enonce": "Draw in color 5 the eight lines that go from the center of the screen, (160, 100), to the eight points stored in the BOUTS table.",
      "indices": ["A loop of eight passes, with a pointer that moves through the table.", "\`MOVE.L (A4)+,42(A5)\` stores X2 and Y2 in one go and moves on to the next point."]
